<title>UK: Midland Bank ups base rate to 6.25 pct from 6.00.</title>
<headline>Midland Bank ups base rate to 6.25 pct from 6.00.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Midland Bank Plc said on Monday it had raised its UK bank base rate by 25 basis points to 6.25 percent with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Midland Bank is part of HSBC Holdings.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
